WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.769
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:05.138
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:08.407
President Biden made a surprise
trip last week to Ukraine

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:10.443
by taking a 10-hour train ride,

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:12.411
or as the guy next to him
thought,

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:14.280
an 80-hour train ride.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.215
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:18.884
President Biden reportedly
had a difficult time sleeping

00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:21.921
last week on the overnight train
ride from Poland to Ukraine

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.857
and read a briefing memo
on the history of Kyiv

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:28.194
and that didn't
put him to sleep?

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.595
That would have
put the last president

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:31.531
into a multi-year coma.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.065
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:35.335
In a new interview,
President Biden said

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:37.337
that he has
"other things to finish

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.905
before launching a full-blown
presidential campaign."

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:42.041
Like, for instance,
"Yellowstone."

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.343
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.312
According to a new report,
then-President Trump

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.448
was so upset with "Late Night"
host Jimmy Kimmel's criticism

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:50.549
that he asked
White House staffers

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:52.084
to call Disney executives.

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:55.821
And he was apparently so upset
with me that he called my boss.

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:58.457
-That's right, Seth.
I told him to get lost.

00:00:58.457 --> 00:01:00.493
[ Laughter ]
-Good looking out, Wally.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.962
Thank you.
-You're welcome. Yep.

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:05.899
-Vice President Kamala Harris
spoke today in South Carolina

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:08.234
about the Biden
administration's expansion

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.203
of high-speed Internet access.

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.337
Although, it didn't help matters

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.706
that the live stream
started like this.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.576
[ Modem dialing ]

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.312
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:22.915
[ Dialing stops ]

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:24.984
An-n-n-nd we're live.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.619
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.821
House Republicans reportedly
planning to hold hearings

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:30.623
on the Biden administration's
response

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.659
to the toxic train wreck
in East Palestine, Ohio.

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:35.528
And one way or another,
they're going to figure out

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:38.498
how Hunter Biden
sabotaged that train.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:40.266
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:44.169
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis'
book "The Courage to be Free"

00:01:44.169 --> 00:01:45.871
is set to be released tomorrow.

00:01:45.871 --> 00:01:47.974
Look for it
wherever books are legal.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:52.044
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.044 --> 00:01:54.880
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
held a three-day retreat

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.249
over the weekend for top donors
and supporters

00:01:57.249 --> 00:01:58.818
at the Four Seasons
in Palm Beach.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.821
For a $10,000 donation,
you got to meet him.

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:04.257
And for $20,000, you didn't.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:07.526
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.526 --> 00:02:09.195
An alligator
was recently captured

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:12.064
in Brooklyn's Prospect Park
and taken to the Bronx Zoo.

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:14.934
You made it move from Brooklyn
to the Bronx?

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.402
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:19.172
At least try turn it into boots
and let it die with dignity.

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:23.876
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:25.845
Firefighters in North Carolina

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.480
recently rescued
a newlywed couple

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.949
that got stuck
in an elevator for 2.5 hours

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:30.950
after their wedding.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.184
The couple is doing fine

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:34.387
and ready to get on
with their divorce.

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:39.125
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.627
And finally, a woman in Georgia
was arrested last week

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:44.797
after she allegedly drove her
car into a Popeyes restaurant

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.100
because her order
did not have biscuits.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:49.501
Apparently, those biscuits

00:02:49.501 --> 00:02:51.971
are the only thing that
take the edge off the meth.

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.973
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.207
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:57.277
We're off and running.
[ Cheers and applause ]

